<view class="page {{theme}}"><text class="eyebrow">READ WITH A DICTIONARY</text><view class="title">阅读书架</view><view class="subtitle">导入文字，点词查义，保留阅读进度。</view><view class="actions"><button bindtap="onNew">粘贴正文</button><button loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="onImport">导入 TXT / EPUB / PDF</button></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="info">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{chapters.length}}" class="card"><view class="section-title chapter-title">选择要保存的章节</view><button wx:for="{{chapters}}" wx:key="index" class="word-row" data-index="{{item.index}}" bindtap="onChapter"><text>{{item.title}}</text><text class="meaning">{{item.characters}} 字</text></button></view><view wx:if="{{creating}}" class="editor"><input class="field" value="{{title}}" bindinput="onTitle" maxlength="100" placeholder="文章或章节标题"/><textarea class="field article-text" value="{{text}}" bindinput="onInput" maxlength="200000" placeholder="粘贴需要阅读的英文或双语文本…"/><button class="primary" bindtap="onSave">保存并阅读</button></view><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">本机书架</text><text class="small muted">{{rows.length}} 篇</text></view><view class="card"><view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id" class="library-row"><button class="word-row" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onRead"><text class="word">{{item.title}}</text><text class="meaning">{{item.characters}} 字 · 上次第 {{item.progress+1}} 页</text></button><button class="text-button delete" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onDelete">移除</button></view><view wx:if="{{!rows.length}}" class="empty">还没有阅读材料，先粘贴一段文字或导入文件。</view></view><view class="footer">TXT 在本机读取；EPUB 和含文本的 PDF 由配套服务解析后按章节导入。加密 PDF、扫描图片 PDF 和复杂版式暂不保留原排版。</view></view>
